{
  "bvid": "BV11r4y1d7xu",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "94829db50e9b49c80e4f0cd08dc399ce5b0e5323656e39307e0a7cf89820dc27",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 740,
      "end_ms": 2510,
      "text": "我们今天讲两个事儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 2510,
      "end_ms": 3800,
      "text": "这个是第一个视频"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 3800,
      "end_ms": 5380,
      "text": "第一个视频就是说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 10959,
      "end_ms": 16980,
      "text": "年轻人在生活中务必要保持有力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 17940,
      "end_ms": 20360,
      "text": "有自我动员里的状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 20360,
      "end_ms": 25140,
      "text": "那么这个呢要求不是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 27979,
      "end_ms": 32598,
      "text": "容易达成的不是容易达成的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 33340,
      "end_ms": 35910,
      "text": "因为年轻人的活动范围太有限了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 35910,
      "end_ms": 41080,
      "text": "可以做的事情能够给你带来挑战的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 41080,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "text": "比较难的事情太少了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 45260,
      "end_ms": 46730,
      "text": "很多事情要花钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 46730,
      "end_ms": 48800,
      "text": "很多事情你没有那个身份"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 48800,
      "end_ms": 50090,
      "text": "没有那个资格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 50090,
      "end_ms": 51660,
      "text": "你也做不了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 53500,
      "end_ms": 56680,
      "text": "那我们要讲的就是说呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 56680,
      "end_ms": 60850,
      "text": "在这种条件受限的情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 60850,
      "end_ms": 64160,
      "text": "人要保证自我动员力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 64440,
      "end_ms": 67110,
      "text": "你自己始终是一个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 67110,
      "end_ms": 68460,
      "text": "遇到紧急情况"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 68460,
      "end_ms": 70800,
      "text": "危险情况是可动员的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 70800,
      "end_ms": 71880,
      "text": "可征召的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 71880,
      "end_ms": 72900,
      "text": "自己动员自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 72900,
      "end_ms": 74539,
      "text": "自己征召是自己"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 75260,
      "end_ms": 77260,
      "text": "或者说被动人被征召"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 77260,
      "end_ms": 79270,
      "text": "被历史的进步力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 79270,
      "end_ms": 81520,
      "text": "被历史的解放性的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 81520,
      "end_ms": 83800,
      "text": "被历史的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 86160,
      "end_ms": 90500,
      "text": "代表这个广大人民的长远利益的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 90500,
      "end_ms": 93080,
      "text": "动员征召的那种状态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 93700,
      "end_ms": 96060,
      "text": "那对于绝大部分的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 96400,
      "end_ms": 98560,
      "text": "我要给的建议就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 112530,
      "end_ms": 114440,
      "text": "进行生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 114440,
      "end_ms": 116540,
      "text": "但实际上是消耗活动啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 116540,
      "end_ms": 118610,
      "text": "一个是体育锻炼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 118610,
      "end_ms": 123430,
      "text": "每周严格要求自己形式化的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 123430,
      "end_ms": 126820,
      "text": "就是不要去管他的那个什么实质啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 126820,
      "end_ms": 129160,
      "text": "或者不管他的这个什么目的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 129160,
      "end_ms": 134859,
      "text": "就是说每个星期给自己安排两到三次呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 134859,
      "end_ms": 139520,
      "text": "可以抵达自己的生理极限啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 139520,
      "end_ms": 141710,
      "text": "啊然后我就不要求你超越了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 141710,
      "end_ms": 142760,
      "text": "因为你每次抵达"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 142760,
      "end_ms": 146100,
      "text": "实际上说身体过量补偿都是超越的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 146100,
      "end_ms": 147750,
      "text": "比如说进行长跑啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 147750,
      "end_ms": 149580,
      "text": "或者进行一些无氧运动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 149580,
      "end_ms": 151680,
      "text": "每个星期两到三次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 153360,
      "end_ms": 155930,
      "text": "锻炼自己的体力和耐力啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 155930,
      "end_ms": 160490,
      "text": "可以说跑步啊或者远足啊啊长途跋涉啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 160490,
      "end_ms": 164260,
      "text": "或者说是啊一定要超出自己的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 164260,
      "end_ms": 167080,
      "text": "这个也就是有有这个成长性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 167080,
      "end_ms": 168340,
      "text": "有增长性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 168600,
      "end_ms": 171720,
      "text": "我最最最起码的说你到达你的极限了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 171720,
      "end_ms": 174000,
      "text": "然后稳在这个上面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 174000,
      "end_ms": 178229,
      "text": "每个星期都在两到三天啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 178229,
      "end_ms": 179609,
      "text": "两到三次的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 179609,
      "end_ms": 181439,
      "text": "然后中间是休息期"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 181439,
      "end_ms": 183340,
      "text": "恢复期只有一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 184260,
      "end_ms": 186280,
      "text": "其次呢就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 194880,
      "end_ms": 199540,
      "text": "就是给自己定下来每天看多少页的书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 199540,
      "end_ms": 201910,
      "text": "或者每天看多少页啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 201910,
      "end_ms": 203160,
      "text": "多少的这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 206439,
      "end_ms": 208169,
      "text": "外文的新闻啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 208169,
      "end_ms": 212410,
      "text": "外文新闻网站啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 212410,
      "end_ms": 214900,
      "text": "额定下来额定下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 214900,
      "end_ms": 217360,
      "text": "只要坚持这个东西形成习惯了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 217360,
      "end_ms": 220180,
      "text": "你就像上瘾一样戒不掉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 220180,
      "end_ms": 222220,
      "text": "一天不看心发慌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 222220,
      "end_ms": 223540,
      "text": "一天不看心发慌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 223540,
      "end_ms": 224470,
      "text": "每天就举"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 224470,
      "end_ms": 227660,
      "text": "主要是我当年呃读书的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 227720,
      "end_ms": 232880,
      "text": "每天强迫自己看什么十篇论文或是怎么样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 232880,
      "end_ms": 235280,
      "text": "或者看40页或者50页的书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 235280,
      "end_ms": 239709,
      "text": "就强迫自己强迫自己啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 239709,
      "end_ms": 241839,
      "text": "那我我建议的一个量啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 241839,
      "end_ms": 242859,
      "text": "我比较建议的一个量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 242859,
      "end_ms": 248200,
      "text": "就是说每天强迫自己看20页的比较有趣的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 248200,
      "end_ms": 248740,
      "text": "我举个例"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 248740,
      "end_ms": 249820,
      "text": "你可以看齐泽克"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 249820,
      "end_ms": 250930,
      "text": "齐泽克的那些书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 250930,
      "end_ms": 252700,
      "text": "看起来就跟看小说一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 252700,
      "end_ms": 255739,
      "text": "你每天强迫自己看20页嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 255739,
      "end_ms": 257719,
      "text": "到后面的话你会越看越多啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 257719,
      "end_ms": 259159,
      "text": "一天甚至可能看50页"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 259159,
      "end_ms": 260260,
      "text": "能看100页"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 260279,
      "end_ms": 262600,
      "text": "一天能看他1/3本书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 262600,
      "end_ms": 264340,
      "text": "就是如果你有时间的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 264340,
      "end_ms": 266350,
      "text": "你坐在那边一个下午"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 266350,
      "end_ms": 268990,
      "text": "一天他的书就看了1/3本"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 268990,
      "end_ms": 271880,
      "text": "就看起来很快到他到后面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 271880,
      "end_ms": 275210,
      "text": "他的书就是我靠两三天一本的那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 275210,
      "end_ms": 277289,
      "text": "看他玩的嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 277289,
      "end_ms": 281189,
      "text": "然后这个这个然后你就可以去看更难的书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 281189,
      "end_ms": 282359,
      "text": "更困难的书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 282359,
      "end_ms": 283559,
      "text": "更难一点的书"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 285149,
      "end_ms": 289860,
      "text": "那我们呃就是个人学习方面的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 290240,
      "end_ms": 294280,
      "text": "就是用一种无脑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 294280,
      "end_ms": 297640,
      "text": "比较无脑的一种这种空转的方式去学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 297640,
      "end_ms": 299620,
      "text": "强迫自己学习啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 299620,
      "end_ms": 300400,
      "text": "不达标的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 300400,
      "end_ms": 301300,
      "text": "心里面就难受"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 301300,
      "end_ms": 304480,
      "text": "就就有点自己心里面就难"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 304480,
      "end_ms": 306820,
      "text": "要有点惩罚自己的那个那个倾向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 306820,
      "end_ms": 310120,
      "text": "第二天赶紧就是说你今天是20页没看完"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 310120,
      "end_ms": 311830,
      "text": "你明天赶紧要看40页"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 311830,
      "end_ms": 312760,
      "text": "有这种感觉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 312760,
      "end_ms": 314460,
      "text": "有一种强迫症"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 315220,
      "end_ms": 321280,
      "text": "那我要给一些嗯这个原则进行一个总结"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 322879,
      "end_ms": 326860,
      "text": "也是有力量永远好过没力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 328260,
      "end_ms": 330020,
      "text": "如果这个力量无法施展"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 330020,
      "end_ms": 332980,
      "text": "那你让这个力量蜷起来自己转"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 333639,
      "end_ms": 336569,
      "text": "就像一个小孩在妈肚子里面的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 336569,
      "end_ms": 340740,
      "text": "但这是知乎上面的一个哈黑暗笑话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 340740,
      "end_ms": 342300,
      "text": "说什么两岁的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 342300,
      "end_ms": 343860,
      "text": "她妈妈问问那个小孩儿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 343860,
      "end_ms": 345960,
      "text": "你你你在妈妈肚子里面在干嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 345960,
      "end_ms": 347220,
      "text": "两岁可能刚会说话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 347220,
      "end_ms": 348540,
      "text": "还有一点那个时候的记忆"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 348540,
      "end_ms": 351440,
      "text": "她说无聊在玩脐带"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 351440,
      "end_ms": 353360,
      "text": "或者说无聊在喝水吐水"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 353360,
      "end_ms": 354380,
      "text": "喝水吐水睡觉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 354380,
      "end_ms": 355220,
      "text": "喝水吐水"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 355220,
      "end_ms": 357270,
      "text": "就他很无聊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 357270,
      "end_ms": 358170,
      "text": "很无聊的情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 358170,
      "end_ms": 360150,
      "text": "他也是在进行一个游戏的重复"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 360150,
      "end_ms": 365240,
      "text": "重复的一个游戏的有力量永远好过五部力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 365400,
      "end_ms": 368130,
      "text": "如果这个力量没办法让你施展开来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 368130,
      "end_ms": 370260,
      "text": "那你就全在蜷缩起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 370260,
      "end_ms": 371040,
      "text": "在书本里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 371040,
      "end_ms": 373530,
      "text": "或者说在体育锻炼里面重复性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 373530,
      "end_ms": 374910,
      "text": "你包括我打游戏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 374910,
      "end_ms": 377730,
      "text": "因为那个玩这个游戏对我来说还有点挑战性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 377730,
      "end_ms": 378630,
      "text": "我能力不行嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 378630,
      "end_ms": 383130,
      "text": "我玩这游戏一直不能赢啊啊好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
